
#### Delete with subquery
```python
from sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker
from sqlalchemy import create_engine
from sqlalchemy.sql import select
from your_model import User, Address  # Replace with your actual model import

# Create a new session
engine = create_engine('your_database_url')
Session = sessionmaker(bind=engine)
session = Session()

# Subquery to find the users to delete
subquery = session.query(User.id).join(Address).filter(Address.city == 'New York').subquery()

# Delete operation using the subquery
session.query(User).filter(User.id.in_(subquery)).delete(synchronize_session=False)
session.commit()
```
